description = "The hit that wakes a sleeping nightmare, from any Warden, lands in full on every nightmare touching it too."
tip = "A ring is a hit from a bell. Every 4th ring on a nightmare is a Toll: it lands again at half damage (on a Bellflower start the first Toll is ring 2). Works for: any Warden. Safe: it works with this {family}, Sprouts and Thornwalls alone."
